            "value": "An unknown device wanted to request your location.\n\nYour location has not been shared with this device so far.\nIf you add it, you can choose whether it gets access and which location data is shared.\nYou can also ignore it. Then it receives no location data and only appears in the visitor history on the \"this Device\" tab."
